<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>TMR: third-party licences</title>
<style>
body { font-family: Segoe UI, sans-serif; max-width: 60em; margin: auto; padding: 1em; }
pre { white-space: pre-wrap; background: #f4f4f4; padding: 1em; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<h1>TMR (Test Memory R): third-party licences</h1>
<p>tmr.exe is built with these crates. Each licence is given once, with the crates under it.</p>
<ul>
{{#each overview}}<li><a href="#{{id}}">{{name}}</a> ({{count}})</li>
{{/each}}</ul>
{{#each licenses}}
<h2 id="{{id}}">{{name}}</h2>
<ul>
{{#each used_by}}<li><a href="{{#if crate.repository}}{{crate.repository}}{{else}}https://crates.io/crates/{{crate.name}}{{/if}}">{{crate.name}} {{crate.version}}</a></li>
{{/each}}</ul>
<pre>{{text}}</pre>
{{/each}}
</body>
</html>
